{"job_id":"F-5f2f3dafada988dcc2a7","family_id":"F-5f2f3dafada988dcc2a7","title":"선원노동위원회규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":9,"target_id":"e75128b9e2af9d11807ff0f1312923987b32ae6763672911cd6af83179409f92","source_hash":"41be595039fa68cc5b097647421329beb4d78eeb41943f55cb8bf03abbedec5a","text":"海员劳工委员会规章"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":93,"target_id":"58ad2696f2f5c1647da3c9462542634a06802419ddb86fd6409654bdf5f47911","source_hash":"4df96527ba2c5504603e0dca9be03910eac5f6900d4804b46d6c2bb471b0e4c5","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是根据《海员法》第四条第二款的规定，规定海员劳动关系委员会（以下简称“委员会”）需要处理的事项。<1985年9月12日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":93,"end":198,"target_id":"a583b4a6678b0921dd5cfad1932547a6cebbef81f662d5574b1709154f091814","source_hash":"c992eef4607af39286ebb2d3444f8db79981bc165c6fdc56c7658f33ad96752a","text":"第二条（适用范围）除劳动关系委员会法或海员法另有规定外，有关委员会的事项适用本法令的规定；本法令未规定的事项适用劳动关系委员会法实施法令的规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":198,"end":390,"target_id":"a5acf8ab052f786f3ad89072dfc9f624623f11679539624637cbe014fb4974a1","source_hash":"feee6403d850c42bd7fc7695e671f8d4cefe65ccdaf2b0863b2c6bb08e59dc25","text":"第三条（名称、地点和管辖范围）委员会的名称和地点应如附表所示，其管辖范围为对其所在地具有管辖权的海洋事务和渔业区域办事处的管辖范围。但是，如果海​​洋事务和渔业部长认为有必要，委员会也可以管辖其他海洋事务和渔业区域办事处的管辖范围。<1978年3月4日、1996年8月8日、1997年5月24日、2008年2月29日和2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":390,"end":744,"target_id":"7bd45e467fe0fae0c159bf5c8cc2174f37d6c2191fc41851b1f6d4fbaea13078","source_hash":"2e3e1bf58b8c8290e44917ca7bb6f4a9439af5fcb3921418a562544c99abc9ba","text":"第四条（组成等）\n① 委员会由四名工人代表（以下简称“工人成员”）、四名雇主代表（以下简称“雇主成员”）和四名公益代表（以下简称“公益成员”）组成。\n② 工人代表和雇主代表由海洋渔业部长根据海洋渔业区域办事处主任的推荐，从相关海洋渔业区域办事处辖区内工会和雇主组织推荐的人员中任命。<1994年12月23日；1996年8月8日；1997年5月24日；2008年2月29日；2013年3月23日修订>\n③ 公益委员由海洋渔业部长根据区域海洋渔业局局长的建议任命。<1996年8月8日；1997年5月24日；2008年2月29日；2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":744,"end":1011,"target_id":"3ace9b736b95f4845c1f8505b80b85ce8ad860032f2597d9d0cab1aabc9825cb","source_hash":"1f9c96e172e46a6f9ae2b0bfcccdf01f44d471ec18300031a5d7645f4802b4d9","text":"第四条之二（推荐工人及雇主成员的方法） 工会和雇主协会根据第四条第二款的规定，应区域海洋渔业局局长的要求，推荐工人及雇主成员进入委员会时，应当按照下列规定进行：<1997年5月24日修订>\n1. 应从相关工会的成员中推荐固定数量的工人代表，这些成员应具有多年的劳工运动经验。\n2. 雇主会员应从相关雇主协会的会员企业主或企业经理中推荐整数倍的人选，这些会员应在劳动问题方面具有深厚的专业知识。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1011,"end":1308,"target_id":"2b98d8b19b8651ca85c2ea3247f0743eaf474d5b4ec494698723191eb7a92e67","source_hash":"b7d034b1cd1ed3bb0bf86920b69d030dfec90dcd96167ede3f10bbad2ee5d096","text":"第四条之三（公益成员推荐标准）公益成员应从符合下列各款规定的人员中推荐。<1999年8月23日修订；2006年6月12日修订>\n1. 在大学担任经济学或法学副教授或以上职称至少两年的人员\n2. 具有海事安全法庭法官、检察官、法官或调查员资格的人员，或从事法律执业至少两年的律师\n3. 担任国家公务员4级或以上，或担任高级公务员一般公务员至少4年，且具备劳动问题知识和经验的人员。\n4. 被公认为在其他劳动事务方面拥有广泛知识和经验的人员\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1308,"end":1562,"target_id":"02646072edd25ecda7c6130eac25303a79636b46dba75b2664f89e57b015fc8d","source_hash":"6e6fc51b4b99d78742555186cdafca2414539176c7df810fab786b5926507a04","text":"第四条第四款（主席和副主席）\n① 委员会设一名主席和一名副主席；主席由海洋渔业部长根据海洋渔业区域办事处主任的推荐，从公益委员中任命；副主席由委员会从委员中选举产生。<1994年12月23日；1996年8月8日；1997年5月24日；2008年2月29日；2013年3月23日修订>\n② 主席主持委员会事务并代表委员会。\n③ 副主席协助主席工作，并在主席缺席时履行主席的职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1562,"end":1640,"target_id":"967c27bea7250947156c2c9bedf4ce1430274a03b65f05b9e31e7f580951ad97","source_hash":"fe3f4c4db5e11f0eebb262f0d5235fdd0a4e8b8f20c81872e68aa1c926a15837","text":"第五条（成员资格取消的理由） 凡属《国家公职人员法》第三十三条第一款所列情形者，不得委任为委员会成员（以下简称“成员”）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1640,"end":1775,"target_id":"2ae2054c77d1fd20d01c8b8b8b4daf408afcf683197934a53a3f7bc4801b522e","source_hash":"7130226816277846d8f192754b0659ff484454596a0dc4332006e81f726ec12d","text":"第六条（秘书长）\n①应委任一名主任担任委员会秘书处。\n② 主任应同时兼任委员会所在地区域海事渔业局五级或以上公职人员，负责海员事务。<1978年3月4日、1982年6月14日、1997年5月24日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1775,"end":1883,"target_id":"167b3d096c0b3b5a0ca78d84e9e0b0806c1cf177edcff45f5a35d1ab4145545a","source_hash":"d970670fcac4d8b391a15600b66b0e91b1db39849f255c573ad23ef45e19c846","text":"第七条（秘书处的行政事务）秘书处的行政事务由委员会所在地区域海事和渔业局中负责海员事务的公职人员共同履行。<1978年3月4日修订；1997年5月24日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1883,"end":2026,"target_id":"84f61e74c762414db61790dbf24c2138a5e05492f3d08b6999086388f4b33614","source_hash":"02b3d1825241b0981246caf79693b8b56e568618a5840feaafeb043fcd182f9e","text":"第八条（相关公职人员出席）  海洋渔业部长可应委员会要求或认为必要时，安排其管辖范围内的公职人员出席委员会会议并发表意见。<1978年3月4日、1996年8月8日、2008年2月29日、2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2026,"end":2126,"target_id":"9da3f3d8be74858e12f9029ba700304a9fc52e914ac79ca73831b8b1b9f6e194","source_hash":"13e1cfa8cd59042f7ee5cde9ff87d3c99fd324cc3525200389c8fa36ea05d2ee","text":"第九条（津贴和差旅费）海洋渔业部长可在预算范围内向议员支付津贴和差旅费。<1978年3月4日、1996年8月8日、2008年2月29日、2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2126,"end":2233,"target_id":"9803060440bb58b0451d3cf360b12d291141db87aea41d0a3681b5b175c0f207","source_hash":"2e75da3dbaec867da2b2bc29cfb6885631c950623c76ab2567b1c812052f761c","text":"第十条（详细实施细则）除本法令另有规定外，委员会运作所需事项由海洋水产部长决定。<1978年3月4日、1996年8月8日、2008年2月29日、2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2233,"end":2278,"target_id":"096ba3fbfc7d8833aaed86fe9ff6d1ab564d5131bc367a9999cf630eb6127412","source_hash":"878766213d66efd4f13f3c4a5e35f9885bbfe78ca7576365dc16491b281ca5ac","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 4454，1969 年 12 月 12 日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2278,"end":2321,"target_id":"9aeaa0fcf3908f39d9534ab0d1f3bbed381df4c106dd7f700c46b7e7a7992206","source_hash":"31b85fe915bc2788a15f27243e504907096368ccb7f56152f77d1defc66baf48","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 8878，1978 年 3 月 4 日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2321,"end":2375,"target_id":"7d500af8b51d80383a41f2f3a8b708e490455f7ad1883c68976e690eefd15ed2","source_hash":"3210c62aeceede1f709716e37a314dc8313b48cb9655f7d612f184376e1bca43","text":"补充规定 <第10841号，1982年6月14日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起30日后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2375,"end":2407,"target_id":"6337e9170d1525cfb7f9012ce0df988b350fcbb10a3304d9a1eba3f7e670d9a6","source_hash":"953751a172a37c6a8f94c2d9064471f5ebacd277fbd2e815761e5f2e05609a1f","text":"附录（《海员法》实施令）<1985年9月12日第11764号法令>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2407,"end":2438,"target_id":"56fbbe004ebe2d350d09fd99fdd3b2dd2f1b96a6e16d969dcd4ca31d0b626f05","source_hash":"de0ec285fd3ffce32091f02ba3a05908eaef136736b1d9962924dadd14284017","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2438,"end":2539,"target_id":"eec90dd42f2658415180bc4e33f126849fe508df17da48579e53343900dcebbe","source_hash":"a364a8c45d7224e1bc5a861cc2c3f6608a2d37a40d35da8b8925fb37dd05399c","text":"第二条（废止和修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ②《海员劳动关系委员会条例》修改如下。\n\n  第 1 条中的“海员法第 6 条第 2 款”应改为“海员法第 4 条第 2 款”。\n\n  ③ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2539,"end":2547,"target_id":"a1623e9d610d93c8c36d63f81edfbbb427a39ede0b0dab02a0bbfc55c7e6e11b","source_hash":"fab18bd1e0d74a271eea817ca2d5dff62d53ec4d5214a8c48af3c4adbab54a93","text":"第3条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2547,"end":2587,"target_id":"8074d24b64f768e412076729184589ab9a5f64b6d8bf03c4fdb6d1b1b13b2ed5","source_hash":"2653a3a1a1d40da8e0a6f6910c0653bad94f7f0264b770e0de8d9e5930b34255","text":"增编（建设和交通部及其附属机构的组织结构）<1994年12月23日第14447号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2587,"end":2624,"target_id":"c5197edc724d4ea2dfb5a2d120ad4ea36a9e09f98f570ab8eab2ed369423267c","source_hash":"773659737282da03f78c27950fe11db6937e1e2a8425fab0a5dd070de87fa809","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2624,"end":2639,"target_id":"96be652dd89144b23a5048c5e80683dd472aa981770b8827bb25507e06c5e547","source_hash":"119c19aa8cf5d20a95854f948299b43b564b2b8788981249c71d35dec8490177","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2639,"end":2766,"target_id":"15409f3ed47a7a96c654c57f38a6bd648b6f7649dd673f082b8404af5968eb87","source_hash":"47f01ee4dc0de250066a2b139781eb9983eb66a437757d35b132e90f8fba1744","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<155> 已省略\n\n  <156> 海员劳工委员会规章修订如下。\n\n  在第 4 条第 2 款和第 4-4 条第 1 款中，“交通部长”应改为“建设和交通部长”。\n\n  <157> 至 <205> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2766,"end":2804,"target_id":"d2c41d97002ca193323a90e4a6c6d3e802d93069013bae84b4681b94e6457150","source_hash":"f31b036c36b6781bc898eb60000c2f94f1e8f7fa7db58813ed42d53cc720aab4","text":"增编（海洋渔业部及其附属机构的组织结构）<1996年8月8日第15135号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2804,"end":2834,"target_id":"bffc5b852ede0055fc7ac9b5023628d3e334275f30ae76ba07b15ca8175ea3ea","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2834,"end":2849,"target_id":"b7d6afb5bccbcfbb52b82552d31cfcdfff30217f66d33b0cfc430fb31f2f09c1","source_hash":"5a59a79dd14cf60a8856d88c6eeec15a3bcd860d4b2df98e6a6f94e4ec6af028","text":"省略第 2 至 6 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2849,"end":3009,"target_id":"902ad370c5817416b81ffbd47ca3a32a2ac7e3a38b3fc966391694d19dd8cba9","source_hash":"b4baa36893c22d8b0b22adb2eb7e2a250cb484d68b31528e3fc4a8decf69cd16","text":"第七条（修改其他法律）①至<97> 已省略\n\n  <98> 海员劳工委员会规章修订如下。\n\n  第 3 条中，“海事和港口管理局局长”应改为“海洋和渔业部长”。\n\n  在第 4 条第 2 款和第 3 款以及第 4 条第 4 款第 1 款中，“交通部长根据海事和港口管理局局长的建议”应改为“海洋和渔业部长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3009,"end":3072,"target_id":"21499a47e1285c2baf292654cb1ba8a14efc4a56d760881a13cdaa30ce35a9b0","source_hash":"135864880c2986bb9b5729b11ca2f15923883ce50265026c86f4591583852232","text":"  第 8 条至第 10 条中，“海事和港口管理局局长”应改为“海洋和渔业部长”。\n\n  <99> 至 <116> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3072,"end":3080,"target_id":"e73cc09938b930e42d29e4e3db3e135570bcee6f173fd1eb70f9a39e44dae7f9","source_hash":"b0a2f8baaefa661aa8c51a30216cb8d4988038b9219a65ce930bf6416c0027e0","text":"第8条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3080,"end":3119,"target_id":"a772c06d899e85a77954bb7abd795671e3b30a54777956cdd4758712f48bec24","source_hash":"97c377e74489e59e5d807ec4989ffe46545a524b57f7aae6e9171fa60913e961","text":"增编（海洋渔业部及其附属机构的组织结构）<1997年5月24日第15379号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3119,"end":3149,"target_id":"5a6fd299533ed16e07172059ec71b733c56b6fd38118208c0eb3f3fffa2f79de","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3149,"end":3163,"target_id":"2720b51bc8ef7dd0d0732013d5211402d51ce380d79af59d5ccdf426714ea75f","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3163,"end":3358,"target_id":"4a4296adda63e65a33cc3ce79ca7328dfd4456db83bea13f46a5100e06eeaa5e","source_hash":"3ccc87f37131fccae943678c61c8f65afafc20d75ef0895ae6b5be7ec2ff884a","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至⑬ 已省略\n\n  ⑭ 海员劳动关系委员会条例修订如下。\n\n  第3条、第4条第2款、第6条第2款和第7条中的“区域海事和港口管理”应改为“区域海事和渔业管理”。\n\n  在第 4 条第 2 款和第 3 款中，第 4 条第 2 款正文和第 4 条第 4 款第 1 款中，“区域海事和港口管理主任”应改为“区域海事和渔业管理主任”。\n\n  ⑮ 至 <33> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3358,"end":3372,"target_id":"8b6e1205d4d84b43a0a066322423a59f1081495d769bd5e1b8bd74d95e7c70ba","source_hash":"4b87e02ca9503bb94edb2c7a9dfdab22b7d49ab57a32d27934511236c46896b6","text":"第5条和第6条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00037","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3372,"end":3416,"target_id":"6bc8ab25b90c33a4d294f52c1f01b074d47748c55f73932ce3a4eadb4b1d372d","source_hash":"f18fac243d317277d9f005abf27e669bd62843a88fe8661f54fcdd4113601f3c","text":"补充文件（《海事事故调查和裁决法》实施令）<1999年8月23日第16541号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00038","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3416,"end":3446,"target_id":"84643dc2ff73761403dbce49ad280fbfdbd849420c93e6ca2822120369fbcd20","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00039","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3446,"end":3548,"target_id":"72eba68693758a3d3689905c27870f8d93101c1f3e573ee743175496d28f9fb3","source_hash":"63b4429237adad341dbf62ccb8b72e32cc4365cb708a9551ba7ee40d7f2a24b5","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至⑤ 已省略\n\n  ⑥ 海员劳动关系委员会规章修订如下。\n\n  第 4-3 条第 2 款中的“海事事故法庭”应改为“海事安全法庭”。\n\n  ⑦ 到 ⑬ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00040","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3548,"end":3922,"target_id":"ac1e927b8655584d0b97a9495fd43cc2b19f4b1e9484876b2113b21f4d386582","source_hash":"8b06215fd4821edb056b49418e0c37dcb6d5adfd9350d74bd87dca5617d3b35b","text":"增编（海洋渔业部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第18059号，2003年7月25日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（修改其他法律）海员劳动关系委员会条例修改如下。\n\n  继附表济州海员劳动委员会之后，新成立大山海员劳动委员会和平泽海员劳动委员会如下。\n\n  ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n  ┃ 大山海员劳动委员会 │ 忠清南道瑞山市 ┃\n\n  ┃ 平泽海员劳动关系委员会 │ 京畿道平泽市 ┃\n\n  ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┷━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00041","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3922,"end":3959,"target_id":"201cdbce81f52f8f372cc6a8cb19affa8cafdb5a43fde7dc2edf89670dc2e0e5","source_hash":"73f247a6c3d9b50b5dc028e6cd54c4b438285c68aede5fb19915c06efce776db","text":"附录（高级公务员人事条例）<第19513号，2006年6月12日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00042","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3959,"end":3995,"target_id":"1401ddddf1b7e61893f8336d737a7ddf3aeb0e14a575ffcfe390a72060208e6e","source_hash":"0e94a08c2a71f70cb6d96527e2a9581ff50930d0b9f006904c6179e63655524b","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2006年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00043","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3995,"end":4009,"target_id":"dd1171fd5862aaf6d81382e501c7da61230507d25d28ce294aa760ba7a35d6b4","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00044","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4009,"end":4163,"target_id":"0cfd6f04c44ad8bf5fafe0dfcc8cc2ca1328542966125af14d2f2b8a9c5dc441","source_hash":"5cdb53719451790b97ba5e1266220804f60c854e927ddda93326d52702a0066a","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<128> 已省略\n\n  海员劳工委员会条例部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第 4-3 条第 3 款中，“4 级以上国家公务员”应改为“4 级以上国家公务员或属于高级公务员的普通公务员”。\n\n  <130> 至 <241> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00045","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4163,"end":4205,"target_id":"5d927e51d69d788c52db06793ac8b01cb0b5fa7c51c923f5298753c7689ba546","source_hash":"ace05d9bd4cb79e1459638d561bf0df7e2489f5f40f2af83178dd552c7089c0b","text":"增编（国土交通海事部及其附属机构的组织结构）<20722号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00046","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4205,"end":4347,"target_id":"8c88a2109c581e93d53c79751d2e435fd9578a91d9b6245fdbcc34d3afba3814","source_hash":"4b2f1f77fa1bc0cebced50765049d562d94a43ba2a05f16714e5d366762876c6","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第六条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00047","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4347,"end":4414,"target_id":"f6a8f205a4421e6bb2b31db7a2acdd1968a61eb92e10528cb6484964761310ba","source_hash":"0ee3114659773d8adcbd751a616821869bbabc446f7afb349b5412437f555461","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<64> 已省略\n\n  <65> 海员劳资关系委员会条例部分内容修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00048","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4414,"end":4518,"target_id":"96b6a29112ee01667aa845898bf3bfd2f28d8b9008debe55687642b155d40483","source_hash":"acc51c2068ff0f2dfc452b0b608117004bd9e86a559b170d293c7b0a07f34b5e","text":"  在第3条但书、第4条第2款和第3款、第4条第1款、第8条、第9条和第10条中，“海洋和渔业部长”应改为“国土、交通和海洋事务部长”。\n\n  <66> 至 <138> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00049","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4518,"end":4560,"target_id":"78463ce989b3150e9fd855b344717bc9e25152d7a8f2b3f263f6290511d0fac8","source_hash":"886d1979faf30a0c2170387cbedf47e82fbcf861e58aea6a47468e7fbef01dba","text":"增编（国土交通部及其附属机构组织结构）<2013年3月23日第24443号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00050","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4560,"end":4613,"target_id":"dc4dd69ec33ebc42461ccafac17d3a8bb3214224b3af5672a4f8be910e917a0b","source_hash":"dc785e61eb083544c21fd75114f65b74787fde08455156b4e7122c52f8fe235c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00051","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003921-287143-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4613,"end":4680,"target_id":"84f12ba64da2a60371cd6fa47ac30ad1cbad5ecfdb56b7f2cef2640d80acab07","source_hash":"3d153977d5659cffa11f6ed9685142fbcf1b4a9697a2580c431b86f90c43a1a